    <string name="onboarding_1_title">Private local processing</string>
    <string name="onboarding_1_body">Lunas DPI intercepts traffic on this device and applies circumvention strategies locally. Nothing is sent to a Lunas server.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_title">No remote VPN server</string>
    <string name="onboarding_2_body">This is not a traditional VPN. Your public IP is not hidden and traffic is not relayed through the cloud.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_title">Android VPN permission</string>
    <string name="onboarding_3_body">Android requires the VPN permission so Lunas DPI can create a local TUN interface. Grant it when you enable protection.</string>
