    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Lunas DPI does not require an account. It does not upload traffic, browsing history, packet contents, or DNS queries. Diagnostics stay on the device unless you export them yourself.\n\nHTTPS is not decrypted. There is no custom certificate and no TLS interception.\n\nLua plugins run in a sandbox: they cannot read other apps, access the TUN device, or load extra code from the network. A plugin may only touch the permissions you grant when you enable it.\n\nIf Discord auto-start is enabled, an Accessibility service watches only whether Discord, Kettu, or Revenge became the foreground app. It does not read messages or screen content.</string>
    <string name="not_a_vpn_disclaimer">This application is not a traditional VPN and does not provide anonymity or hide the user\'s IP address.</string>
